{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fb807388-53a4-8d2c-bdbb-6845dac980dc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T11:55:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm calling about Christmas tree pickup. I want to know when it happens and where I put the tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Are you in the city, on a regular trash route?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 2 Bridge Street, down in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 2 Bridge Street. Let me pull that up. Give me a second here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry if I sound slow. I was up late reading and I'm a little groggy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, it's almost noon on New Year's Eve, nobody's sharp. So, trees. They get picked up curbside in January, separate from your regular trash. Take the lights and ornaments and any stand off, and don't bag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag. Okay. Do you know which week for my street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm looking at the schedule. It's tied to your regular collection day, so put it out the night before or early that morning, the same as you would your barrel. If it's not gone a day or two after, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Also, my recycling bin has a cracked lid and one handle is broken. How do I request a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in a request for that right now. Cracked lid, broken handle, so that's the recycling bin, not the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. The recycling bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Replacement recycling bin, 2 Bridge Street. Can I get a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:24-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-nine. Perfect. It usually takes a little while for bins to get delivered, and they'll drop it at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is there anything I need to do with the old one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just leave it out where it is. They'll swap it when they bring the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's everything. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Happy New Year, Angela."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
